test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7008303Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7008694Z                         goal.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7008947Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7009238Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7009528Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7009829Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7010129Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7010448Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7010705Z                         field solution.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7010981Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7011285Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7011573Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7011907Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7012178Z                         local solver jobs.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7012412Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7012692Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7013018Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7013350Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7013633Z                         not manufacturability.
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7013921Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7014239Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (windows-latest, 3.12)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-01T17:33:10.7014505Z                         processor works.
